Symbolic icons copied unchanged from adwaita-icon-theme (GNOME Project).
License as upstream: CC-BY-SA-3.0 or LGPL-3, and CC-BY-SA-4.0.
https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme

Fallback for the app's own UI when the selected icon theme lacks these names.

The dm-status-*-symbolic icons are renamed copies (object-select,
folder-download, dialog-warning) so the update marks look the same
in every icon theme.
